    "before": "extra-small",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Preparing Stone Tools for Mass Production </h2>",
   "body": "<p>All tools, from coarse grinding to fine polishing, are entered sequentially in a single process; the contours are automatically compared, and deviations are displayed immediately. ZOLLER devices optimize measurement and correction values in relation to one another and can also handle automated data transfer directly to the CN control—without repeated set up. This ensures that the entire tool set adjusts perfectly, significantly reducing both setup time and machine downtime. The finished edges: simple excellent!</p>",
